# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
#
# A denylist, deliberately: the build only needs the Go module and the assets
# its //go:embed directives name, but an allowlist ("ignore everything, then
# re-include *.go") depends on how each Docker version expands `**` under an
# excluded root and has silently dropped the sources on one engine while
# including them on another. Excluding the few large or irrelevant trees is
# stable everywhere and keeps the context small.
bin/
dist/
cover.out
Dockerfile.cross
.git/
**/*_test.go
